  "description": "The WORLD vocoder in C# for .NET 8 and later, faster than the original C++ in every measured stage. Fundamental frequency estimation with Dio, Harvest and StoneMask, spectral envelope estimation with CheapTrick, aperiodicity estimation with D4C, batch and real-time synthesis, and the spectral envelope codec. No managed allocation, Native AOT ready, and verified against the original C++: most stages are bit-exact and the rest are bounded in ULP.",
